From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: sunxi: h616-ahub: reset IEC958 conversion on prepare

Convert the first playback samples after prepare and underrun recovery.

Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun50i-h616-ahub.c b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun50i-h616-ahub.c
--- a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun50i-h616-ahub.c
+++ b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun50i-h616-ahub.c
@@ -763,6 +763,7 @@
 	u32 enable;
 
 	if (substream->stream == SNDRV_PCM_STREAM_PLAYBACK) {
+		sdai->hdmi_appl = 0;
 		regmap_update_bits(ahub->regmap,
 				   SUN50I_AHUB_APBIF_TX_FIFO_CTRL_REG(sdai->apbif),
 				   SUN50I_AHUB_APBIF_TX_FIFO_CTRL_FLUSH,
